This product includes and displays data from the STALZONE item database:
https://github.com/EXBO-Studio/stalzone-database

The database is provided by EXBO Studio under the Apache License 2.0.
No EXBO database files are redistributed by this application; they are requested
from the public repository by the user's browser.

The application includes a static EU auction-history snapshot obtained from
STALZONE WIKI and derives rarity-specific median sale-price estimates from it:
https://stalzone.wiki/

STALZONE WIKI is operated by the STALZONE LAB community. The snapshot is
historical market data and is not an endorsement or guarantee of current prices.
